
⚠️  WARNING: ARM64 Architecture Detected
==================================================
✗ solc binaries are x86_64 only, and qemu is not installed

To use solc-select on ARM64, you can:
  1. Install software for x86_64 emulation:
     sudo apt-get install qemu-user-static  # Debian/Ubuntu
     sudo dnf install qemu-user-static      # Fedora
     sudo pacman -S qemu-user-static        # Arch
  2. Use an x86_64 Docker container
  3. Use a cloud-based development environment
==================================================

